# Local dev secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and
# fill in. In production both are set via `wrangler secret put` (or the
# Deploy to Cloudflare button, which prompts for both). Both are secrets, not
# plain wrangler.jsonc `vars` — see the comment there for why (a plain var
# gets silently overwritten on every deploy).

# Basic-auth username every request must present alongside MIRROR_SECRET.
MIRROR_USER=

# Basic-auth password every request must present. Generate with:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
MIRROR_SECRET=
